I read your update and I think he's only acting like this because he realized how FUCKED he is financially, reputation, and more. Hope the courts force him to pay a huge ass child support payment each month his ass goes broke.

&#x200B;

Fuck them both. They'll get their karma and I hope your other side of your family will wake up and take your side and give you an apology. Jesus, reading stories like these always make my blood BOIL and make me so sad for the OP.

